\n- DS-MoE: sparse inference\n- EPD-Serve: Ascend NPU multimodal\n- ElasticMoE: CloudMatrix384\n- SambaNova SN40L: dataflow compilation\n\n**From Q3.6 (Codegen)**:\n- CUDA Graph: kernel launch staticization\n- ACS: out-of-order scheduling\n- Warp Specialization + TMA (Hopper)\n- Software Pipeline (cp.async/TMA)\n- GSPMD + XLA TPU backend\n- Groq deterministic compilation\n- Cerebras dataflow compilation\n- TileLang T.Pipelined\n- MLIR async dialect\n\nNow I need to organize these into two classification dimensions per the skill instructions, maintain specificity, and write the output.\n\nLet me write the comprehensive horizon summary now.","signature":"0030f884-3efd-4bb7-a4f5-6b5f67c5fcc3"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":104969,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1703d43a-f329-49a8-8513-c161f26c0cde","uuid":"1761ffc9-1331-4da1-928d-bd4268e93764"}
